{"id":"b317b32e88081cdf","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Complete Boolean Algebra","display":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra — ZFC Forcing Complete Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra — ZFC Forcing Complete Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra — ZFC Forcing Complete Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\n\\land \\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\times\\mathbb B\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b)\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathbb B\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}c))\\to b\\leq_{\\mathbb B}c)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\n\\land \\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\times\\mathbb B\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b)\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathbb B\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}c))\\to b\\leq_{\\mathbb B}c)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The seven-place predicate exposes the Boolean operations required by the actual upstream signature; the two-place predicate is its existential reduct.</li>\n<li>Completeness is expressed by the universal property of a supremum instead of an undeclared infinitary join term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ (see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\n\\land \\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\times\\mathbb B\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a)\\\\\n&\\quad \\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b)\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathbb B\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}c))\\to b\\leq_{\\mathbb B}c)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}^{\\mathrm{op}}_S\n(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})","display":true}],"bytes":1971,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5b7ea7de596a92e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B\\in M$, $\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\subseteq\\mathbb B^2$, and $\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"7c724dbc1a48b779","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9d13d70315b40a86","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cf4fb7b3eb8fd5af